[00:08.62]She walks on red carpets everywhere she goes (她就像个女王走到哪都耀眼夺目)
[00:12.56]You can find her, all designer from her head to toe (一眼就让你上心 她从头到脚无不是杰作)
[00:16.72]Out in calabasas, she think she the baddest, yeah (豪宅名所里挥洒自若 她自信昂然又火辣 （calabasas为地名）)
[00:20.66]But your heart is plastic, that shit ain't attractive, yeah (但是女孩儿你的心如廉价塑料 那东西不值得怜惜)
[00:24.59]Can you be a real human for a second please? (能不能在我面前活得真实点哪怕一秒？)
[00:28.51]This ain't TV no one's watching, this just you and me (这儿不是电视里 没有万众瞩目 唯独你我)
[00:32.43]Girl what's your problem? why you think you're better than me? (亲爱的，快清醒点，你的骄傲到底源自于哪里？)
